# "fyrir" + DATIVE is the offset back: "fyrir tveimur árum" (two years
# ago).  The same headword takes the ACCUSATIVE for "before <event>"
# ("fyrir næsta sunnudag"), a different construction that this locale
# does not read.  Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fyrir (preposition,
# dative sense "ago" and accusative sense "before").
fyrir
